      <description><![CDATA[<h2>AVIZ PRO 1.0.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed a crash when opening a scene with text effects (for example Phonk punch) while the node map was being laid out.</li>
<li>Road: the sun is no longer doubled in the wet asphalt reflection.</li>
<li>The project title no longer shows the .avizproj extension; the shader editor shows code right away.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
